---
/**
 * The two-column fact table used on all three content pages.
 *
 * Thin on purpose. The `<tbody>` is the whole reason it exists: three pages
 * hand-wrote the same table/tbody/tr nesting, and a `<tr>` that loses its
 * `<tbody>` gets one invented by the parser in a place the stylesheet does not
 * expect.
 */
---
<table class="facts"><tbody><slot /></tbody></table>
